<title>ITALY: Shares in Italy's Unicem suspended -Consob.</title>
<headline>Shares in Italy's Unicem suspended -Consob.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Italian cement producer Unicem have been suspended from trading with immediate effect pending an announcement, a spokesman for market regulator Consob said.</p>
<p>Unicem, controlled by holding company IFI, has been at the centre of speculation in recent weeks that it might be sold to another company.</p>
<p>Unicem shares closed at 12,467 lire on the Milan bourse on Monday.</p>
<p>--Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
